      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's a profound loss, and the silence is just the echo of everything you used to be. That feeling of being a ghost is a sign that the person you were was a massive, beautiful, and ultimately unsustainable part of you. Give yourself permission to let that quiet settle into something else, something that doesn't require the constant, exhausting performance of being \"you.\" Just letting go of the pressure, even in the most quiet way, is the only real victory you have now.",
