    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"letting go of the pressure\" ... i dont know. it feels less like letting go and more like just fading away. like i'm waiting for a clock to run out. it's hard to see any version of the future where i'm not just this... leftover version of someone. i feel like the story is already written and it's just a very long, empty epilogue.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
