      "content": "but that's the thing, i don't want a new chapter. i don't want to struggle through a new version of myself that feels like a lie. what if the \"final chapter\" is just realizing that the story was actually finished back then? like, maybe it's more dignified to just stop here than to keep dragging out this empty part. it feels like i'm just lingering.",
